                "text": "Yesterday I met with Jenny Black, the new CEO of @PPPSWHealth. Jenny and I break down the encouraging news from the court this week and what it means to Medicaid patients seeking basic healthcare services. I\u2019ll keep fighting alongside Planned Parenthood for reproductive freedom. https://t.co/xh4S8XI0D7",
