                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This violates the VA\u2019s sole mission to provide care to our veterans. Forcing doctors to decide if the life of a patient is at stake before intervening is dangerous and barbaric. Abortion is healthcare and our government has no place in the private healthcare decisions of any American.",
