                "text": "President Trump continues to attack our veterans and jeopardize their healthcare. This time, ending VA union contracts and taking away the right to organize for a better, safer workplace. I stand with our workers and our veterans in fighting this blatant union busting. https://t.co/c5Oj3r3uzK",
