                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The \u201cBig Beautiful Bill\u201d makes it even harder for people to become doctors by eliminating the student loan program that half of all medical students rely on. Fewer doctors, combined with drastic Medicaid cuts, is a recipe for a public health disaster.\nhttps://t.co/b2pve2uEs8",
