                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Did you know seniors on Medicare are at risk of losing access to ~800 common lab tests come January?\n\nIf Congress doesn't act, we will need to dramatically reduce reimbursements for these tests, meaning many companies will stop accepting Medicare or go out of business.\n\nI just introduced the RESULTS Act with @RepHudsonNC, @RepGusBilirakis, @SenatorWarnock, and @SenThomTillis to make sure we don't risk our seniors' health.",
