                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We borrow more than $2 trillion a year just to keep the lights on. This is unsustainable.\n\nWe spend more on interest on the debt than on Medicare, Medicaid, or defense. Imagine the investments we could make for working people if we didn't have this burden.",
