                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Yesterday, I hosted a virtual press conference with @RepSaraJacobs and @RepMikeLevin to discuss the costly and painful Republican-owned shutdown. The partisan budget bill would allow the cost of healthcare to skyrocket for millions of Americans starting today, October 1st. House Democrats remain ready and willing to reach a bipartisan agreement to fund the government and lower health care costs for Americans.",
