                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "President Trump - the self proclaimed \u201cdeal maker\u201d - knew government funding would run out on September 30. He knew Americans would get notices today that their health insurance bills will go up because of the \u201cBig Beautiful Bill\u201d written and passed by Republicans. Delaying a funding bill now is unacceptable.",
