                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Grocery costs and energy prices are skyrocketing, and millions are about to lose their healthcare. Yet President Trump's priority, per his Press Sec, is demolishing the White House\u2019s East Wing for a $300 million ballroom. The American people didn't ask for a Presidential ballroom. They want affordable health care.",
