                "text": "It\u2019s good news that the longest government shutdown will end. But I voted against the continuing resolution because it fails to address the healthcare crisis or reaffirm Congress\u2019 sole authority over the power of the purse.\n\nRead my full statement \u2b07\ufe0f\nhttps://t.co/NSYvUsGEln",
